# Leading spaces do not help.
-- input.cnf --
[mydumper]
  = value
-- diagnostics --
2:1-2:10 error MDL107[empty-key] line starts with `=`: there is no key before it (GLib: Key file contains line “  = value” which is not a key-value pair, group, or comment)
  = mydumper ignores this entire file: it only logs a WARNING ("Failed to load config file") and runs with its defaults, exit code 0.
